    "## About Matrix\n\nMatrix is a high-performance, all-in-one SaaS workspace built to replace the patchwork of separate tools most teams juggle. Projects, people, customers, and finances all live in a single, cohesive ecosystem — and the data flows between them.\n\n### The Problem We Solve\n\nMost growing teams stitch together 5–10 different subscriptions: a CRM here, a task manager there, invoicing somewhere else, docs in yet another tab. The result is **tool fatigue**, broken integrations, and data trapped in silos. Matrix exists to eliminate that — one login, one interface, one source of truth.\n\n### Five Modules in One Workspace\n\n- **📊 Project & Task Management** — Kanban workflow with drag-and-drop boards, customizable columns and priorities, task hierarchies with subtasks and full parent–child relationships, real-time collaboration with instant updates across the team.\n- **🤝 Customer Relationship Management (CRM)** — Centralized contact database for clients, leads, and stakeholders, a sales pipeline that tracks every customer from first lead to closed deal, and full engagement tracking with interaction history and status monitoring.\n- **👥 Human Resource Management (HRM)** — Employee directory with detailed records, full lifecycle management from onboarding through performance tracking, and granular workspace roles for precise permission control.\n- **🧾 Professional Invoicing** — Generate professional invoices with built-in **Stripe** integration, automated status tracking (Draft, Paid, Overdue) updated in real time, and itemized billing with detailed line items, tax, and quantity calculations.\n- **📄 Document & Knowledge Management** — Collaborative docs with internal and external sharing on the same document, full version control that tracks every change and reverts to any previous version, and granular public/private access control.\n\n### Enterprise-Grade from Day One\n\n- **🔀 Multi-Workspace Support** — Seamlessly switch between organizations or departments.\n- **📜 Audit Logging** — Complete traceability of actions for security and compliance.\n- **🔒 Secure Multi-Tenancy** — Hard data isolation between workspaces.\n- **📈 Scalable Architecture** — Built for horizontal scaling from the ground up.\n\n### Built on a Modern, High-Performance Stack\n\nA stack chosen for **speed, security, and developer experience** — and one that translates into a noticeably faster product for end users.\n\n- **Frontend** — Next.js 15 (App Router) + TypeScript\n- **Backend** — Bun + Elysia.js (ultra-low latency)\n- **Database** — PostgreSQL via Prisma ORM\n- **Caching** — Redis (sessions + performance)\n- **Auth** — Better Auth (RBAC + multi-tenancy)\n- **UI/UX** — Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n\n### Why Matrix\n\n- **Replace 5+ tools** with one subscription.\n- **Stop losing context** between modules — data flows, not fragments.\n- **Built to scale** with multi-workspace and multi-tenant architecture from day one.\n- **Modern UX** — clean, accessible, fast.\n\n*Developed with a focus on rich aesthetics, performance, and developer experience.*\n",
